{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y5ZQFsr1DCAfUfDHgw5iey","type":"tool_result","content":"**Full name:** The page says the pattern is matched against \"the enclosing suite names and the test name joined with `' > '` (the same string shown in the reporter output).\" Its example is a test named `adds` inside a `math` suite, which has the full name `math > adds`.\n\n**Separator:** Current Vitest uses ` > ` (space, greater-than, space). The page's warning says that before Vitest 5, segments were joined with \"a single space (`math adds`) to mirror Jest.\"\n\n**Version note:** The page has one warning, which says the older space-only joining applies before Vitest 5. It links to the migration guide for details."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f8985615-1507-44ff-b333-8fd7e96f0ee8","uuid":"7c537592-4a7d-44b6-9f97-f496acfa358b","timestamp":"2026-10-08T12:38:27.810Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":66757,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Full name:** The page says the pattern is matched against \"the enclosing suite names and the test name joined with `' > '` (the same string shown in the reporter output).\" Its example is a test named `adds` inside a `math` suite, which has the full name `math > adds`.\n\n**Separator:** Current Vitest uses ` > ` (space, greater-than, space). The page's warning says that before Vitest 5, segments were joined with \"a single space (`math adds`) to mirror Jest.\"\n\n**Version note:** The page has one warning, which says the older space-only joining applies before Vitest 5. It links to the migration guide for details.","durationMs":5054,"url":"https://vitest.dev/config/testnamepattern"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Y5ZQFsr1DCAfUfDHgw5iey","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
